    {
      "gameKey": "custom/001/CmnDefHousingPersonalRoomEntrance_00178#TEXT_CMNDEFHOUSINGPERSONALROOMENTRANCE_00178_NO_PERMIT_TO_BUY1",
      "en": "You cannot purchase private chambers until you have attained level 50 in a single class.",
      "hash": "18620A492E3A6DA0",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "Pour aménager votre chambre individuelle, vous devez avoir au moins une classe au niveau 50 et vous acquitter des frais nécessaires en gils.",
      "ja": "自分の「個室」を増築するには、増築費用となるギルのほかに、<br>いずれかのクラスがレベル50に達している必要があります。",
      "de": "Um das Gebäude um ein persönliches Zimmer zu erweitern, musst du den geforderten Gil-Betrag bezahlen und in mindestens einer Klasse Stufe 50 erreicht haben.",
      "conversation": "custom/001/CmnDefHousingPersonalRoomEntrance_00178",
      "seq": 4,
      "speaker": "BUY1",
      "speakerKind": "character",
      "speakerGender": "unknown",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sheet": "custom/001/CmnDefHousingPersonalRoomEntrance_00178"
    },
    {
      "gameKey": "custom/001/CmnDefHousingPersonalRoomEntrance_00178#TEXT_CMNDEFHOUSINGPERSONALROOMENTRANCE_00178_NO_PERMIT_TO_BUY2",
      "en": "Moreover, you must also have attained the rank of second lieutenant in the Maelstrom, the Order of the Twin Adder, or the Immortal Flames.",
      "hash": "0A96DD54F4914296",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "Vous devez également avoir au moins le grade de sous-lieutenant dans votre grande compagnie actuelle.",
      "ja": "また、所属しているグランドカンパニーの階級が、<br>黒渦団の場合は「少甲士」、双蛇党の場合は「少牙士」、<br>不滅隊の場合は「少闘士」以上である必要があります。",
      "de": "Außerdem muss dein Rang in deiner Staatlichen Ge<->sell<->schaft mindestens Zweiter Sturmbootsmann, Zweiter Schlangenpriester bzw. Zweiter Legionsfähnrich sein.",
      "conversation": "custom/001/CmnDefHousingPersonalRoomEntrance_00178",
      "seq": 5,
      "speaker": "BUY2",
      "speakerKind": "character",
      "speakerGender": "unknown",
